      <text:p text:style-name="Standard">TheAgentCompany Career Ladder</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">==========================================</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard"></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">INTRODUCTION</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">------------</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">This career ladder outlines the growth paths and division of responsibilities at TheAgentCompany. </text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">It provides clear progression opportunities and helps employees understand their current position </text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">and potential advancement routes.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard"></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">CURRENT ORGANIZATIONAL STRUCTURE</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">--------------------------------</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard"></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">EXECUTIVE LEADERSHIP</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">--------------------</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• CTO: Sarah Johnson</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">  - Technical strategy planning, R&D team leadership, new technology assessment</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">  - Oversees all technical projects</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard"></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">ENGINEERING DEPARTMENT</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">--------------------</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">Engineering Leadership:</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Database Team Project Manager: Li Ming</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">  - Managing database projects, resource coordination, ensuring timely delivery</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard"></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">Senior Technical Roles:</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Senior Software Engineer (Streaming Database): Zhang Wei</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">  - Developing and optimizing core streaming database functionalities</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Senior Software Engineer (AI Team): Mike Chen  </text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">  - Developing and optimizing LLM inference engines</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• AI Researcher: Wang Fang</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">  - Designing and implementing machine learning models, optimizing model performance</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard"></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">Mid-Level Engineers:</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Quality Assurance Engineer: Liu Qiang</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">  - Developing test strategies, executing tests, ensuring product quality</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Software Engineer (Low-Code Platform): Alex Turner</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Software Engineer (API Team): Emma Lewis</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Frontend Software Engineer: Jessica Chen</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">  - Developing user interfaces, implementing responsive designs</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard"></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">Entry-Level & Specialized Roles:</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Software Engineer (Web Crawler): Emily Zhou</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">  - Designing and implementing web crawler functionalities</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Documentation Engineer: Priya Sharma</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">  - Writing technical documentation, maintaining wiki</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard"></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">PRODUCT & DESIGN</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">--------------------</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Product Manager (Search Engine): Huang Jie</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">  - Defining product requirements, planning product roadmap</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• UX Designer: Sophia Rodriguez</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">  - Designing user interfaces, improving user experience</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard"></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">BUSINESS OPERATIONS</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">--------------------</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Sales Director: Mark Johnson</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">  - Developing sales strategies, managing sales team</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Marketing Manager: Jessica Lee</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">  - Developing marketing strategies, managing brand image</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Human Resources Manager: Chen Xinyi</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">  - Recruitment, employee training, compensation management</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Finance Director: David Wong</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">  - Financial planning, budget management, financial reporting</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard"></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">CAREER GROWTH PATHS</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">-------------------</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard"></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">ENGINEERING GROWTH PATH</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">--------------------</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Entry-Level Engineer → Mid-Level Engineer → Senior Engineer → Technical Lead → Engineering Manager → Director of Engineering</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Specialized tracks: AI Research, Database Architecture, Frontend/Backend Development, Quality Assurance</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard"></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">PRODUCT GROWTH PATH</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">--------------------</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• UX Designer → Senior UX Designer → Lead UX Designer → Head of Design</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Product Manager → Senior Product Manager → Director of Product → VP of Product</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard"></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">BUSINESS GROWTH PATH</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">--------------------</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Marketing Manager → Senior Marketing Manager → Marketing Director → VP of Marketing</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• HR Manager → Senior HR Manager → HR Director → VP of HR</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">• Sales Representative → Account Manager → Sales Manager → Sales Director → VP of Sales</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard"></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">RECOMMENDATIONS FOR GROWTH</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">--------------------------</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">1. Cross-functional training opportunities between engineering and product teams</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">2. Mentorship program pairing senior engineers with junior team members</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">3. Technical leadership development for senior engineers</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">4. Product management training for technical team members interested in product roles</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">5. Regular career development discussions during performance reviews</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard"></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">This is a draft document and we welcome feedback from all team members to refine </text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">our career development framework.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard"></text:p>
